{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04858","headline":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 二 · 张均","name":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湾潭幽意深，杳霭涌寒岑。\n石痕秋水落，岚气夕阳沈。\n澄彻天爲底，渊玄月作心。\n青溪非大隐，归弄白云浔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}